:: {.card title=\"What the test says\"}\n**Result:** Video earned a **2.63%** click rate versus **1.78%** for image.\n\n**Is it real?** A two-proportion test gives p = **<0.001**. That is below 0.05, so the difference is unlikely to be chance.\n\n**Takeaway:** Lead RKR's section with video when production time allows.\n:::\n\n# Data\n\n\n::: {.cell title='Issue level data (illustrative sample until real data is collected)'}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"datatables html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-091ff1d4b623c13d42de\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-091ff1d4b623c13d42de\">{\"x\":{\"filter\":\"top\",\"vertical\":false,\"filterHTML\":\"<tr>\\n  <td data-type=\\\"date\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: top;\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"form-group has-feedback\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: auto;\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"search\\\" placeholder=\\\"All\\\" class=\\\"form-control\\\" style=\\\"width: 100%;\\\"/>\\n      <span class=\\\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove-circle form-control-feedback\\\"><\\/span>\\n    <\\/div>\\n    <div style=\\\"display: none;position: absolute;width: 200px;opacity: 1\\\">\\n      <div data-min=\\\"1770249600000\\\" data-max=\\\"1810166400000\\\"><\\/div>\\n      <span style=\\\"float: left;\\\"><\\/span>\\n      <span style=\\\"float: right;\\\"><\\/span>\\n    <\\/div>\\n  <\\/td>\\n  <td data-type=\\\"character\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: top;\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"form-group has-feedback\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: auto;\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"search\\\" placeholder=\\\"All\\\" class=\\\"form-control\\\" style=\\\"width: 100%;\\\"/>\\n      <span class=\\\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove-circle form-control-feedback\\\"><\\/span>\\n    <\\/div>\\n  <\\/td>\\n  <td data-type=\\\"character\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: top;\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"form-group has-feedback\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: auto;\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"s